(1000044,2025,'2025-10-13 10:55:02','Ghatkopar','11th Science',3.0,3.0,5.0,'Honestly, my overall experience this class has been truly memorable and enriching. From the very first day, I’ve learned not just through books but also throughteractions, teamwork, and the amazing guidance of our teachers. Every lecture, discussion, and group activity helped me grow both academically and personally. The environment was always supportive, encouraging us to ask questions, share ideas, and improve ourselves.'),
