(1000048,2025,'2025-10-13 11:15:41','Ghatkopar','11th Science',1.0,2.0,2.0,'My overall experience at Mayank Tutorials has been quite positive. Joining thisstitute has helped me strengthen my academic foundation and gain a better understanding of several important . The environment here is student-friendly and motivating, which encourages consistent learning and improvement.

One of the biggest strengths of Mayank Tutorials is its faculty. The teachers are knowledgeable, approachable, and always willing to help students understand difficult topics. Their teaching style makes even complex subjects easier to grasp.

In particular, I would like to mention Dinesh Sir, Jiya Ma’am, and Sana Ma’am. All three have played a crucial role shaping my learning experience. Dinesh Sir explains every topic detail and ensures that no student is left behind. Jiya Ma’am is patient and supportive, making sure that her classes areteractive and engaging. Sana Ma’am’s clarity of explanation and dedication make her sessions very effective and enjoyable.

The classes are well-structured and focused on both conceptual clarity and practical application. The notes and study materials provided are also useful for revision and exam preparation. The faculty’s constant support and encouragement make learning here a rewarding experience.

However, I feel that the test experience could be improved. The test papers sometimesclude errors and mistakes, which can be confusing and affect students’ confidence. A little more attention to accuracy and paper quality during tests would make the overall experience even  

Despite this issue, my overall journey with Mayank Tutorials has been good. The excellent teaching, supportive faculty, and motivating atmosphere make it a great place for learning. With some improvements the test process, I believe it can become one of the best coachingstitutes for students.'),
