(1001362,2025,'2025-10-14 20:14:30','Chembur Naka','9th ICSE',3.0,2.0,3.0,'Overall, the classrooms have really small benches and its hard to continue to sit there for a long period since we have 2-3 lectures all together with no breaks. The washrooms are mostly dirty and not spacious either. And there are too many tests like we have to do school work as it is, practice by ourselves at home and for the school exams and then also practice for mayank exams, although it helps as revision and preparation, it gets a bit hard to deal with everything and mostly the test the timing is not enough to complete the whole paper since the portion is also greater. And also i think they should be taking more math practice session especially for the students who are weak a particular subject and give more attention to them toostead of making them feel bad about their marks and like giving up on them and only focusing on the students who are better at it,stead they should help strengthen our weak areas and improve for the next exam or chapters and give them some motivation. I think mayank can improve these areas more.'),
