(1001367,2025,'2025-10-14 22:07:48','Chembur Naka','9th ICSE',5.0,4.0,5.0,'A prescheduled Timetable should be there for the entire week or month because it makes us difficult to complete homeworks and to manage our time to those subjects to revise and be prepared.

Practice sessions should be utilised a proper way because there are many sessions for practice but usually we are only told to read and learn and byheart answers and most of the time nothing happens. So I think that variois faculties should be there according to the subjects and should be helpful for us.'),
